randomClothes
  🎲 Shirt/Shorts
    prompt = She wears a white T-Shirt that hangs down from one shoulder. The black strap of her bra is showing. She is wearing very short blue jeans shorts.
    shorts = 1
  🎲 Shirt/Panties
    prompt = She wears a white T-Shirt that hangs down from one shoulder. The black strap of her bra is showing. She is wearing {a thong|a g-string|sating panties}.
  // Corsage Outfits
  👙 Corsage with Pencil Skirt
    prompt = a fitted black pencil skirt made from smooth stretch fabric featuring a dramatically tall corset waistband that naturally blends into the corset and closely follows her curves with a subtle back slit
