  🧪 Underbust Keyhole Swimsuit
    prompt = daring private hot-tub swimsuit consisting of a {[colors.passion]|[colors.sexy]|[colors.jewel]} skin-tight one-piece swimsuit with a scoop neckline and broad shoulder straps. Directly beneath the molded bust, a large teardrop-shaped center-front keyhole cutout exposes her lower sternum and upper abdomen. The opening narrows toward the waist while the swimsuit remains continuously connected along both sides, preserving a clear one-piece construction

  🧪 Asymetric Cocktail dress
    prompt = She is wearing a short cocktail dress with an asymmetrical one-shoulder top. The upper part features a single broad shoulder strap that rises diagonally across her chest, leaving the opposite shoulder completely exposed. This asymmetrical neckline connects directly to a sleek fitted bodice that follows her figure and narrows into a clearly defined waist. The waist connects directly to a smooth fitted mini skirt that gently follows her hips before descending in a clean straight silhouette, with an even horizontal hem ending high on her upper thighs.
  
